WEBVTT

00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:07.210
Manage, next to a client, holds everything else:

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:14.209
edit its name, address and description, its features, its access rules and its activity.

00:00:14.661 --> 00:00:17.751
Features turns features of the client on or off.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:22.271
Features that could reach other sites are hidden, and some are always on.

00:00:22.727 --> 00:00:27.267
Suspend closes the client to everyone, including its own staff.

00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:33.573
Its address then shows that the site is not available, never the platform or another site.

00:00:34.026 --> 00:00:35.876
Resume opens it again.

00:00:35.876 --> 00:00:39.906
To remove a suspended client, type its name to confirm.

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:49.530
The policy keeps removed clients for thirty days, so the client waits, removal

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.187
scheduled, and Restore brings it back.

